The '''Year of the Pig''' is an [[Event]] that happens every {{Green|12}} [[Time Systems|SkyBlock Years]].

== Mechanics ==
During the '''Year of the Pig''', {{NPCSprite|Piggy}} appears in the {{zone|Village}} and {{MobSprite|Shiny Pig;Shiny Pigs}} spawn around the {{Zone|Village}}, {{Zone|Farm}}, and {{Zone|Combat Settlement}}.

== Shiny Pigs ==
{{Main|Shiny Pig}}
{{Item|Shiny Orb}}s can be used on {{MobSprite|Shiny Pig;Shiny Pigs}} to obtain rewards.

== Shop ==
[[File:Year of the Pig area.png|thumb|293x293px|'''Year of the Pig''' area near the [[Museum]].]]
{{Main|Piggy}}
{{NPCSprite|Piggy}} sells items in exchange for {{Item|Shiny Token}}s and other items.
{{:Piggy/UI}}

